Security and data notice\par
\par
This installer is intended for authorized remote access only. The device owner must consent to installation and must authorize attended access. Unattended access is disabled by default and remains visibly indicated when enabled.\par
\par
PeerOnQ preserves the per-user data directory during upgrade, repair, and uninstall so device identity and audit history are not silently destroyed. The Settings page identifies that folder; after uninstall, the data owner may explicitly remove it.\par
